    "rich_text_mW8NjU": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_kaY3tw": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Advantages of Bulk Candles for Businesses",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-2-base"
          }
        },
        "text_pYNLHG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For businesses looking to maintain consistency or meet high demand, Kisco Candles offers bulk purchasing options. Our <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/wholesale-bulk-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bulk candles</span></a> ensure you always have the perfect lighting solution, no matter how large the space or how frequent the need. We provide:</p><ul><li><strong>Cost-Effective Solutions:</strong> Buying in bulk enables you to enjoy significant savings, ensuring your business remains beautifully lit without breaking the bank.</li><li><strong>Consistent Quality:</strong> With bulk orders, you can maintain a uniform look and feel across your entire establishment, creating a seamless and professional atmosphere.</li><li><strong>Variety:</strong> Bulk candles are available in the following types to perfectly match the unique aesthetic of your business:</li><li><strong>Taper:</strong> Tall and elegant, ideal for formal settings and creating a romantic atmosphere.</li><li><strong>Pillar:</strong> Sturdy, versatile, and long-lasting, perfect for any decor style.</li><li><strong>Tealights:</strong> Small and convenient, great for accent lighting and creating a cozy ambiance.</li><li><strong>Floating:</strong> Designed to float on water, perfect for adding a unique touch to decorative displays and events.</li></ul>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_kaY3tw",
