            "title": "Are Your Candles Eco-Friendly?",
            "text": "<p>Absolutely. Our candles are made from plant-based wax and feature braided cotton wicks, so they burn cleanly, making them an eco-friendly choice.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_pcLXBt": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Are Your Candles Dripless and Smokeless?",
            "text": "<p>Absolutely! Our Bolsius Candles are dripless and smokeless, ensuring a clean and safe environment for your business. <strong>Furthermore, unscented varieties are ideal candles for business use, especially for those who are sensitive to certain smells or have allergies.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
