            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How Long Do Your Candles Burn?",
            "text": "<p>Our candles burn for an extended period, providing long-lasting value. Each style of candle has a different burn time – our product description will tell you the number of hours your candle is estimated to burn.</p>"
          }
        }
